    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where both machines and humans struggle to survive, you\u2019ll step into the shoes of Lug \u2014 a seemingly ordinary boy with the power to decide the fate of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Emery Hearts</i> is an action JRPG with a retro soul and modern gameplay. Explore a vibrant voxel-art world, face off against fearsome mechanoids in real-time combat, solve puzzles, and unlock new abilities as you dive into a story filled with emotion, legacy, and mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Features<strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, real-time combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming, exploration, and puzzle-solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats, learn spells, and master different weapon types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative rooted in fantastical science fiction.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where both machines and humans struggle to survive, you\u2019ll step into the shoes of Lug \u2014 a seemingly ordinary boy with the power to decide the fate of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Emery Hearts</i> is an action JRPG with a retro soul and modern gameplay. Explore a vibrant voxel-art world, face off against fearsome mechanoids in real-time combat, solve puzzles, and unlock new abilities as you dive into a story filled with emotion, legacy, and mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Features<strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, real-time combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming, exploration, and puzzle-solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats, learn spells, and master different weapon types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative rooted in fantastical science fiction.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dive into this action JRPG with a retro soul and modern gameplay. Explore a detailed voxel-art world, fight in real time, solve puzzles, and change the fate of a planet on the brink of collapse.",
